Changelog: 22-10-2026 16:20:03

Release 0.3.0.

Changelog: 22-10-2026 15:34:45

Added. Three pills in the header: Portal video tour, Apps video tour and Convert icons, which was a button at the
bottom of the window. Portal video tour records the portal's tour from a suite checkout (its tools/record-tour.sh),
with or without music and, when ticked, the copy on the wiki's Portal Tour page. Apps video tour lists every app
of the checkout's manifest (each program of compute and cores apart) and records the tour of each ticked one
(tools/record-app-tour.sh), at the length chosen. The recordings run in the background, one after another, with
their output in the window; Stop ends the one that runs and what it started; Play plays the video in the tool. The
videos go to ~/Videos. Tests: tests/test_tours.py.

