Changelog: 19-10-2026 16:58:45

Release 0.1.13.

Changelog: 19-10-2026 16:36:08

Breaking. Simple Demo Tool is Media Tool (the owner's names, 19-10-2026). Its folder in the suite is apps/mtool
(was apps/dtool) and its package media_tool (was demo_tool); with the folder go its key in the portal, its
installer test and its release tags: mtool-v<x.y.z> from the next release on. The installed tool is renamed too:
the launcher ~/.local/bin/media-tool (was simple-demo-tool), its folder ~/.local/share/media-tool, its menu entry
and Desktop icon media-tool.desktop, its icons images/media-tool.webp and media-tool-128.png. New recordings go to
~/MediaToolRecordings (was ~/SimpleVideoToolRecordings), the folder the tool sets in OBS. Installing or
uninstalling removes a copy installed under the old name, its launcher, menu entry, Desktop icon and folder; the
recordings in ~/SimpleVideoToolRecordings stay. Its wiki chapter is other-tools/media-tool.md.

Changelog: 19-10-2026 16:16:14

Added. Convert icons… makes a category's icons in a suite checkout from your own images: one image for every
size, an image for a single size, or both. It scales each to its size, saves it as WebP (the 128 px icon as PNG)
under the category's names and copies it to every app of the category, by running the checkout's
tools/sync_icons.py with the tool's own Python. The checkout is found from the chosen portal release or the tool's
own folder, or chosen. The app's environment gets Pillow (requirements.txt, checked by install.sh). Tests:
tests/test_icons.py.

