first app of the release is.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 13:24:38

Release 0.1.10.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 13:17:20

Fixed. The tool's folder in the suite is apps/dtool (was apps/demo-tool) and its package is demo_tool (was
simple_demo_tool): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the tool without its prefix; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the portal, its
installer test and its release tags: dtool-v<x.y.z> from the next release on. Its chapter of the wiki stays under
Other tools. The installed tool keeps its name, its launcher simple-demo-tool, its folder under ~/.local/share, its
settings and the recordings folder. Installing over an older copy removes its package folder under the old name;
the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

