Changelog: 15-10-2026 02:01:27

instance.py follows core's: a second launch can hand its arguments to the running instance (already_running(app_id, args), serve(..., on_args)). This app passes none, so it behaves as before: a second launch shows the open window.

Changelog: 13-10-2026 15:53:27

Release 0.1.6.

Changelog: 13-10-2026 15:51:48

The installer installs the Python packages with pip --upgrade (owner's decision, 13-10-2026): installing again brings each package to the newest version its requirements allow, so a security fix within that range arrives with a reinstall from the portal.

